---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import '../styles/collect.css';
const title = 'Collect — What comes next';
const description = 'Objects worth working toward. A considered wishlist, a research file, and a local acquisition notebook. First on the list: the new Tesla Roadster.';
---

<BlockLayout title={title} description={description} image="/images/collect/roadster-reference.jpg" imageWidth={1200} imageHeight={800} imageAlt="White angular open-top roadster with upward-opening doors in a dark studio; user-supplied reference" isolated includeManifest={false} themeColor="#eae9e2">
  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
    const legacyCollectParams = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
    if (['claim', 'confirmed', 'collect_error'].some(key => legacyCollectParams.has(key))) {
      location.replace('/collect/kennel' + location.search + location.hash);
    }
    })();
  </script>
  <div class="collect-page" data-collect-goals data-revision="collect-v1-20261024">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#collect-main">Skip to collection</a>
    <header class="collect-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="PointCast home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">P<span>·</span></span> POINTCAST</a>
      <nav aria-label="Collect navigation"><a href="#dossier">The dossier</a><a href="#notebook" data-open-notebook>Local notebook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
      <span class="edition-label">An ongoing collection / Vol. 01</span>
    </header>

    <div id="collect-main" class="collect-main">
      <div class="masthead"><h1>Collect<span class="masthead-dot">.</span></h1><p>Objects worth<br />working toward.</p><span class="masthead-index">001—∞</span></div>
      <div class="collection-line"><span><span class="signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> THE WISHLIST</span><span>One object. A considered beginning.</span><a href="/collect/kennel">Kennel Club <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>

      <section class="roadster-hero" aria-labelledby="roadster-title">
        <img src="/images/collect/roadster-reference.jpg" alt="A white, sharply angular open-top roadster, both doors raised, on a dark studio floor." width="1200" height="800" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="hero-topline"><span>OBJECT 001 / AUTOMOTIVE</span><span class="hero-status">RESEARCH WATCHLIST</span></div>
        <div class="hero-caption"><p>A little further down the road.</p><h2 id="roadster-title">The new<br /><span>Roadster.</span></h2></div>
        <span class="image-note">User-supplied reference · exact image provenance &amp; trim unverified</span>
      </section>

      <section class="intro-grid" aria-label="The acquisition goal">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">POINTCAST COLLECT / NO. 001</p><h2>Desire,<br /> with a plan.</h2></div>
        <div class="intro-copy"><p class="lede">A car for the someday file. Let’s make “someday” something we can work toward.</p><p>The new Tesla Roadster is our first acquisition goal. Follow the research, find new resources through PointCast, and make a deliberate decision when the opportunity and the means align.</p><div class="intro-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="#notebook" data-open-notebook>Open local notebook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="button button-light" type="button" data-wishlist aria-pressed="false" disabled>☆ Save to my wishlist</button></div><p class="micro" data-wishlist-status>Wishlist saves stay in this browser.</p></div>
      </section>

      <section class="facts-band" aria-label="Current public record">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">01 / TARGET COST</span><strong>To be determined</strong><p>No confirmed vehicle price.</p></div>
        <div><span class="eyebrow">02 / AVAILABILITY</span><strong>Under development</strong><p>Delivery is not guaranteed.</p></div>
        <div><span class="eyebrow">03 / RESOURCES</span><strong>Funding unverified</strong><p>No allocation confirmed in this public record.</p></div>
        <div><span class="eyebrow">04 / COMMITMENT</span><strong>Research only</strong><p>No reservation or purchase confirmed.</p></div>
      </section>

      <section class="dossier" id="dossier" aria-labelledby="dossier-title">
        <header class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WORK BEHIND THE WANT</p><h2 id="dossier-title">The dossier<span>.</span></h2></div><p>Research checked<br /><time datetime="2026-10-24">24 October 2026</time></p></header>
        <div class="dossier-grid">
          <article class="research-card"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>Know the object.</h3><p>The acquisition target is Tesla’s new Roadster. A variant has not been selected. The supplied photograph is a visual reference; its exact origin and configuration have not been confirmed.</p><a href="https://www.tesla.com/roadster?redirect=no" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tesla · Roadster overview <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="source-label">Official source / reviewed 24 Oct 2026</span></article>
          <article class="research-card"><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>Price the whole picture.</h3><p>Tesla’s US reservation agreement says the exact vehicle price is not yet confirmed. A reservation payment is not the purchase price, an order, or a delivery guarantee.</p><ul class="cost-list"><li><span>Vehicle + selected options</span><b>TBD</b></li><li><span>Taxes, delivery + registration</span><b>TBD</b></li><li><span>Insurance + ownership reserve</span><b>TBD</b></li><li><span>All-in acquisition target</span><b>UNSET</b></li></ul></article>
          <article class="research-card"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>Wait for real conditions.</h3><p>The car remains under development. Timing, final specification, regional eligibility and an all-in quote need a fresh check before any commitment.</p><a href="https://www.tesla.com/configurator/api/v4/terms?locale=en_US&amp;model=mt&amp;saleType=PreSale" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tesla · US reservation agreement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="source-label">US v.20261015 / reviewed 24 Oct 2026</span></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="path-section" aria-labelledby="path-title"><div class="path-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE ACQUISITION PATH</p><h2 id="path-title">Earn the next<br /> step.</h2><p>Interest becomes research. Research becomes a decision. The receipts come before the keys.</p><a href="#notebook" data-open-notebook>Record the next useful lead <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><ol class="gates"><li class="gate-current"><span>01</span><div><h3>Define &amp; research</h3><p>Choose a variant. Confirm the image, intended use and current official terms.</p></div><b>NOW</b></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Source new resources</h3><p>Track promising projects and opportunities. A lead is potential, not money received.</p></div><b>OPEN</b></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Verify &amp; allocate</h3><p>Confirm realized proceeds, commitments and costs. Explicitly set aside only what is available.</p></div><b>GATE</b></li><li><span>04</span><div><h3>Make the owner’s decision</h3><p>Recheck the all-in quote, availability and ownership costs. Mike approves any reservation or acquisition separately.</p></div><b>GATE</b></li></ol></section>

      <section class="notebook-section" id="notebook" aria-labelledby="notebook-title"><details data-notebook><summary><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKING COPY / BROWSER-LOCAL</p><h2 id="notebook-title">The acquisition notebook.</h2><p>Keep leads, evidence and allocations distinct.</p></div><span class="notebook-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="notebook-content"><div class="storage-note"><span class="signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>Entries save only in this browser on this device. They do not update the public record or sync to an account. Use non-sensitive references; leave bank details, private emails and credentials out.</p></div><noscript><p>JavaScript is required to use the local notebook. The research above remains readable.</p></noscript><p class="status-message" data-tracker-status role="status">Local notebook is loading…</p>
        <div class="local-totals"><div><span>Prospective leads</span><strong data-total-leads>0</strong><small>Not received or allocated</small></div><div><span>Realized, unallocated · USD</span><strong data-total-realized>—</strong><small>Owner-entered, not independently verified</small></div><div><span>Explicitly allocated · USD</span><strong data-total-allocated>—</strong><small>Owner-attested draft, not a balance</small></div></div>
        <div class="notebook-columns"><form data-resource-form><h3>Add a resource record</h3><label>Short title<input name="title" required maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. A new PointCast project" /></label><div class="form-pair"><label>Stage<select name="stage"><option value="lead">Prospective lead</option><option value="realized">Realized · unallocated</option><option value="allocated">Realized · allocated to 001</option></select></label><label>Record date<input name="date" type="date" required /></label></div><label>Amount · USD <span data-amount-hint>(optional estimate for a lead)</span><input name="amount" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" max="100000000" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Leave blank if unknown" /></label><label>Evidence reference <span data-evidence-hint>(optional for a lead)</span><input name="evidence" maxlength="500" placeholder="Non-sensitive source or receipt reference" /></label><p class="field-help">A local note records your assessment; PointCast does not verify receipts or access accounts.</p><label class="allocation-check" data-allocation-row hidden><input name="allocationConfirmed" type="checkbox" /><span>I have verified this resource was realized and explicitly allocated this amount to Roadster 001.</span></label><button class="button button-dark" type="submit" disabled data-add-resource>Add to local notebook <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="form-error" data-resource-error role="alert"></p></form><div class="resource-records"><div class="records-heading"><h3>Your resource records</h3><button type="button" class="text-button" data-undo hidden>Undo removal</button></div><p class="empty-state" data-empty-records>No records yet.<br /><span>Start with a lead. Add evidence when something is realized.</span></p><ul data-resource-list aria-label="Local resource records"></ul></div></div>
        <form class="notes-form" data-notes-form><div><label>Research &amp; next milestone<textarea name="notes" rows="3" maxlength="2000" placeholder="What would move this from interesting to possible?" /></label></div><div><label>Next review date<input name="nextReviewDate" type="date" /></label><button class="button button-light" type="submit" disabled data-save-notes>Save research notes</button></div></form>
        <div class="notebook-tools"><p>Export a copy to keep or move your notebook. Import replaces this browser’s draft after you confirm.</p><div><button class="button button-light" type="button" data-export disabled>Export JSON <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button><label class="button button-light import-button">Import JSON <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span><input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-import disabled /></label></div></div>
      </div></details></section>

      <aside class="other-collections"><div><p class="eyebrow">ALREADY IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD</p><h2>Small things count, too.</h2><p>The Kennel Club desk and PointCast’s art shelf are still here.</p></div><div><a href="/collect/kennel">Kennel Club <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/collect/shelf">The art shelf <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></aside>
    </div>
    <footer class="collect-footer"><a href="/">POINTCAST <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Observe. Make. Resource. Collect.</p><span>COLLECT / V1 / 2026</span></footer>
  </div>
</BlockLayout>
<script>import '../scripts/collect-goals-client.mjs';</script>
